stop at nothing to find him. There are many who deny the Dark Lord's return, but Harry is not alone: a secret order gathers at Grimmauld Place to fight against the Dark forces. Harry must allow Professor Snape to teach him how to protect himself from Voldemort's savage assaults on his mind. But they are growing stronger by the day and Harry is running out of time...  \n\nTheme music composed by James Hannigan   \n\nHaving become classics of our time, the Harry Potter stories never fail to bring comfort and escapism. With their message of hope, belonging and the enduring power of truth and love, the story of the Boy Who Lived continues to delight generations of new listeners.","maxAge":14,"minAge":9,"abridged":false,"audioPreviewUrl":"https://audio-previews-media.api.yotoplay.com/audio-previews/c2ac1595563a9857899a22457c1b13c0c963f359d4e88e8fb99f3d76def24d80/OonzQiJGwXSnolpcwzkv-bRFUWxpyrGklJ7gI0Qiuao.mp3","accents":["UK English"],"authors":["J.K. Rowling"],"copyrights":["© J.K. Rowling/Pottermore Ltd. TM WBEI."],"cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/4QdwvxgeptueeA3Cj3zSev4do-sukh269BI5AUvqokA"},"genres":["favourite-characters","fantasy","action-and-adventure","modern-classics"],"languages":["en"],"media":{"duration":104520,"fileSize":854226053,"hasStreams":false},"narrators":["Stephen Fry"],"status":{"name":"complete","updatedAt":"2024-08-07T09:20:11.418Z"}},"cardId":"dIcvk","createdAt":"2024-06-07T13:22:55.225Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-08T08:26:48.597Z"},"ownership":{"canAccess":true,"userHasRole":false,"cardIsFree":false,"cardIsMadeByUser":false,"cardIsInFamilyLibrary":false,"cardIsCreatedByFamily":false,"isAccessibleUsingSubscription":false,"isAccessibleAsPhysicalPlay":false,"isShareLink":false,"isReconditionCard":false,"inCardPacks":false,"previewAccessOnly":true}}